"""Which wowsims-forever ladders go into each <class>_ranks.json, and the hand notes per family.

Rule (gen_class_ranks.py): every ladder of sim/<class>/spell_data_auto_gen.go goes in, except
  - a ladder whose every rank is passive (talents, racial passives, talent procs), unless it is the
    triggered/effect ladder of a family that goes in;
  - a "<X>Triggered" / "<X>Effect" / "<X>Bleed" ladder whose base ladder <X> is excluded;
  - the out-of-combat utility listed in UTILITY below (travel, teleports, tracking, resurrection,
    crowd control, dispels, conjured food/water, detection);
  - the pet ability ladders in PET, which go to pets.json.
Every exclusion is written to the file's meta.excluded_ladders with its reason.
"""

